WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 0.3 · Start Here: Your Founder Journey
Baseline health check of your foundations

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Rate each foundation honestly today; most will be not started, and that is fine.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Rate: not started, informal, documented, practised, reviewed.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Back every rating with one piece of evidence.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Ask a co-founder or mentor to rate too, and compare.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You rate each area, give evidence and name three priorities.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
